id: 4
hanzi: 结构
pinyin: jié gòu
level: HSK 5
part_of_speech: Noun

meanings_summary:
  en: structure; composition; construction; framework; architecture of a system
  es: estructura; composición; entramado; conformación interna; arquitectura de un sistema

senses[1]{sense_number,part_of_speech,register,definition_en,definition_es,example_phrase}:
  1 | Noun | Standard | the arrangement of and relations between the parts or elements of something complex; internal framework | disposición y trabazón de las partes que integran un todo complejo; entramado | 语法结构 (grammatical structure)

example_sentences[2]{id,hanzi,pinyin,en,es}:
  #1 | 四字成语大多具有高度对称的语法结构，如主谓、并列或动宾搭配，体现出汉语对仗工整的独特审美。 | Sì zì chéngyǔ dàduō jùyǒu gāodù duìchèn de yǔfǎ jiégòu, rú zhǔwèi, bìngliè huò dòngbīn dāpèi, tǐxiàn chū Hànyǔ duìzhàng-gōngzhěng de dútè shěnměi. | Four-character idioms mostly possess symmetrical grammatical structures like subject-predicate or coordinate pairs, manifesting Chinese aesthetics. | Los modismos de cuatro caracteres suelen presentar estructuras gramaticales simétricas que revelan la admirable estética armónica del chino.
  #2 | 这座历经千年风雨的古代木结构塔楼，凭借精巧的榫卯连接，在多次大地震中依然巍然挺立、完好无损。 | Zhè zuò lìjīng qiānnián fēngyǔ de gǔdài mùjiégòu tǎlóu, píngjiè jīngqiǎo de sǔnmǎo liánjiē, zài duō cì dà dìzhèn zhōng yīrán wēirán tǐnglì, wánhǎo-wúsǔn. | This thousand-year-old timber pagoda, through ingenious mortise-and-tenon joints, still stands intact through earthquakes. | Esta pagoda milenaria de madera, gracias a su ensamblaje de caja y espiga, ha resistido fuertes seísmos manteniéndose erguida e incólume.

collocations[6]{hanzi,en}:
  语法结构 | grammatical or syntactic structure
