semantic_boundary_contrasts:
  core_nuance: 结构 emphasizes the internal relationship and organizational pattern among components of an organic whole.
  contrasts[3]{id,compared_word,pinyin,analysis}:
    1 | 结构 vs. 构造 | gòuzào | 结构 emphasizes the relational framework and balance between parts (句子结构, 产业结构), whereas 构造 emphasizes the mechanical manufacture, geological formation, or structural anatomy (地质构造, 机械构造).
    2 | 结构 vs. 组织 | zǔzhī | 结构 is the static arrangement of pieces, whereas 组织 refers either to dynamic living biological tissue or human sociopolitical institutions.
    3 | 结构 vs. 骨架 | gǔjià | 结构 includes all internal connections and balance, while 骨架 refers strictly to the bare structural skeleton or load-bearing ribs.

extended_reading_passages[2]{id,hanzi,pinyin,en,es}:
  #1 | 走进古典园林，回廊与漏窗之间巧妙的层次结构总能引人入胜。移步换景的精妙设计，打破了原本狭小的物理空间局限，使假山、清池与修竹在错落有致的布局中融为一体，展现出东方营建哲学的高超智慧。 | Zǒujìn gǔdiǎn yuánlín, huíláng yǔ lòuchuāng zhījiān qiǎomiào de céngcì jiégòu zǒng néng yǐnrén-rùshèng. Yíbù-huànjǐng de jīngmiào shèjì, dǎpò le yuánběn xiáxiǎo de wùlǐ kōngjiān júxiàn, shǐ jiǎshān, qīngchí yǔ xiūzhú zài cuòluò-yǒuzhì de bùjú zhōng róngwéiyìtǐ, zhǎnshì chū dōngfāng yíngjiàn zhéxué de gāochāo zhìhuì. | Entering classical gardens, the subtle layered structures between verandas and openwork windows enchant. Changing scenes at every step transcend physical confines, blending artificial peaks, ponds, and bamboo into architectural harmony. | En los jardines clásicos, el juego estructural entre corredores y celosías cautiva la mirada. Su diseño altera la percepción espacial integrando riscos artificiales, estanques y bambúes en una primorosa lección de arquitectura oriental.
  #2 | 在经济全球化面临深刻调整的背景下，优化升级国内产业链与供给侧结构已成为保障经济韧性的关键举措。通过推动传统产业数字化转型，培育战略性新兴产业集群，中国经济正向更高质量的发展轨道坚实迈进。 | Zài jīngjì quánqiúhuà miànlín shēnkè tiáozhěng de bèijǐng xià, yōuhuà shēngjí guónèi chǎnyèliàn yǔ gōngjǐcè jiégòu yǐ chéngwéi bǎozhàng jīngjì rènxìng de guānjiàn jǔcuò. Tōngguò tuīdòng chuántǒng chǎnyè shùzìhuà zhuǎnxíng, péiyù zhànlüèxìng xīnxīng chǎnyè jíqún, Zhōngguó jīngjì zhèng xiàng gèng gāozhìliàng de fāzhǎn guǐdào jiānshí màijìn. | Amid shifts in economic globalization, upgrading domestic industrial and supply-side structures is critical for resilience. Fostering digital transformation and emerging clusters propels the economy toward high-quality development. | Frente a la reorganización económica global, optimizar las cadenas productivas y la estructura de la oferta es vital para la resiliencia. La digitalización fabril y los sectores estratégicos afianzan un crecimiento de alta calidad.
